[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=19 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="接入端口亮起一小圈白光。你没有听见命令，也没有突然恢复记忆。只是很熟悉那只接口，熟悉到手还没抬起来，指腹已经像碰过它一样发麻。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="有一段记录在里面。我可以帮你接，但只能告诉你接通以后会发生什么，不能保证你看见的是完整过去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你以前有没有这样帮过别人？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="有。我没有每次都先问。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她说完，向后退了一步，留出端口前那块很小的地方。弗莱彻没有挡在你面前，也没有站到旁边催你作选择。她问你还缺哪一条信息。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果现在拒绝，会失去以后再看的机会吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我们能带走记录和设备接口。没有证据说明今天是最后一次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果接了，你们能帮我停下来吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="独立断电能做，里面的过程我们不懂。能拔线，不等于知道什么时候该拔。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="这些回答没有把危险变小，却让它有了能说清楚的边。你看向德雷顿，她没有问你想起名字以后会不会离开，只是把自己的耳机调到和你一样的频道。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["tideborn", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我今天没有别的地方要去。你怎么选，我先听你说完。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我还想知道自己是谁。但我不想用你们听不见的那种办法，突然变成一个谁也没办法问的人。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="那就把你现在同意的部分说出来。只到那一步，不往前多算。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="端口的光一直亮着，没有因为你犹豫而消失。你第一次意识到，一个要求你立刻证明勇气的机会，未必是你必须抓住的机会。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="先封存。把能带走的带走。我愿意回来查，不是现在接进去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕替你盖上防水盖，动作比打开时慢。盖扣合上的声音很轻，你却直到听见它，才发现自己一直憋着气。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "perkins", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

